<div class="mt-4">
  <span class="text-sm font-medium">Network <span class="font-normal text-gray-500">(optional)</span></span>
  <div class="mt-1 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
    <label class="block">
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Allow</span>
      <textarea name="allow" rows="3" placeholder="api.example.com&#10;*.npmjs.org" class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm"><%= it.allow ?? '' %></textarea>
    </label>
    <label class="block">
      <span class="text-xs text-gray-600">Deny</span>
      <textarea name="deny" rows="3" placeholder="*" class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-md border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 font-mono text-sm"><%= it.deny ?? '' %></textarea>
    </label>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-gray-500">One host per line: <code>*.example.com</code> for its subdomains, <code>*</code> for all. Deny blocks a name unless allow matches it, and a private address resolves only for a name allow matches.</p>
</div>
